      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary artery disease and valvular dysfunction are long-term complications of mediastinal irradiation. We describe 3 patients who underwent successful combined coronary artery bypass grafting and valve replacement for symptoms related to radiation-induced coronary artery and valvular disease."},
